Motion sickness evaluation and comparison for a static driving simulator and a dynamic driving simulator
Baris Aykent , Frederic Merienne , […] , , , and Andras Kemeny +2 View all authors and affiliations
Volume 228 , Issue 7
https://doi.org/10.1177/0954407013516101

